    "Why you got this result": "Why you got this result",
    "With the voice icon, your audio is sent to Google Gemini for transcription. Review or edit the text, then choose Ask Shosai to send your question for an AI answer. For recorded questions, that written answer is sent to ElevenLabs to create speech. Typed questions stay text-only. Hiraku keeps recordings, questions, answers, and speech only in page memory and clears them when you leave or background this page. Google and ElevenLabs may retain submissions under their own policies. Cancelling cannot retract content already sent or undo provider billing. Microphone access is requested only when you choose the voice icon or Start conversation.": "With the voice icon, your audio is sent to Google Gemini for transcription. Review or edit the text, then choose Ask Shosai to send your question for an AI answer. For recorded questions, that written answer is sent to ElevenLabs to create speech. Typed questions stay text-only. Hiraku keeps recordings, questions, answers, and speech only in page memory and clears them when you leave or background this page. Google and ElevenLabs may retain submissions under their own policies. Cancelling cannot retract content already sent or undo provider billing. Microphone access is requested only when you choose the voice icon or Start conversation.",
