    "Audio playback failed. Try Play again, or read the answer and official sources.": "音訊播放失敗。請嘗試重新播放，或閱讀答案與官方來源。",
    "Automatic playback could not start. Choose Play to listen; the written answer is ready.": "無法自動播放。請選擇「播放」以收聽；書面答案已準備好。",
