    "Count each person who receives either Supplemental Security Income (SSI) or a Cash Assistance grant. SSI is different from Social Security retirement benefits. If only some people receive these benefits, choose No.": "請計算每位領取補充安全收入 (SSI) 或現金援助補助金的人。SSI 與社會安全退休福利不同。如果只有部分人員領取這些福利，請選擇「否」。",
    "Count out-of-pocket care costs, such as paying a child-care provider or paying for care for an adult who needs help. This can change which income guideline applies.": "請計算自付照顧費用，例如支付托育人員費用或支付需要幫助的成年人的照顧費用。這可能會改變所適用的收入標準。",
    "Discovery view": "探索檢視",
    "Distances are calculated from an approximate ZIP/ZCTA internal point, not your address or a travel route. ": "距離是根據約略的郵遞區號 (ZIP/ZCTA) 內部點計算，而不是根據您的地址或行車路線。 ",
    "Do not share names, addresses, Social Security numbers, case numbers, documents, or private case details. We cannot guarantee automatic redaction. Use fictional, general questions for this local demo.": "請勿分享姓名、地址、社會安全號碼、案件編號、文件或私密案件細節。我們無法保證自動進行保密塗黑。本機示範請使用虛構的通用問題。",
