    "Enter a monthly dollar amount of 0 or more, with up to two decimal places. Leave out commas and dollar signs, or choose I don’t know.": "输入 0 或更多的每月金额（最多两位小数）。请勿使用逗号和美元符号，或选择我不知道。",
