    "Enter the total actually paid for children outside your SNAP household each month, including support withheld from pay. Include those withheld amounts in your gross income too, so we subtract them only once. Don’t enter support you receive or money owed but not paid. If you’re unsure which payments count, choose I don’t know.": "請輸入每個月實際為 SNAP 家庭以外的兒童支付的總金額，包括從薪資中扣除的撫養費。您的總收入中也請包含這些扣除額，以便我們只扣除一次。請勿輸入您收到的撫養費或欠繳但未付的金額。如果您不確定哪些付款計算在內，請選擇「我不知道」。",
