    "I received a recertification notice": "我收到了重新認證通知",
    "If everyone receives SSI or Cash Assistance, we check that assistance-based path. Otherwise, we compare income for households of 1–8. The guideline depends on income from work, an older/disabled/blind member, or dependent-care costs. We account for child support paid when it applies.": "如果每個人都領取 SSI 或現金援助，我們會檢查該基於援助的途徑。否則，我們會比較 1 至 8 人家庭的收入。該指針取決於工作收入、年長/殘疾/視障成員或受撫養人照顧費用。我們會在適用情況時計入已支付的子女撫養費。",
    "If work rules stopped your benefits, reapply or request to be added back to your household’s case. HRA must still determine eligibility.": "如果工作規則導致您的福利停止，請重新申請或要求將您重新加入您的家庭案件中。HRA 仍必須確定資格。",
