    "The allowance restarted. The work rules still apply.": "津貼已重新計算。工作規則仍然適用。",
    "The child support paid amount is more than your monthly gross income. We cannot make this comparison from these answers; review the amounts or ask HRA how to count them.": "支付的子女撫養費金額大於您的每月總收入。我們無法根據這些答案進行此比較；請檢查金額或向 HRA 詢問如何計算。",
    "The city’s guide includes an exemption checker, volunteer-hours calculator, reporting instructions, and forms. HRA must document an exemption.": "市府指南包含豁免查詢工具、義工時數計算機、報告說明和表格。HRA 必須記錄豁免情況。",
