    "The geographic basemap is supplied by OpenStreetMap. Tile requests share normal browser/network information and the viewed tile area with that provider. Hiraku does not request your precise location or send a home address. ": "地理底圖由 OpenStreetMap 提供。圖塊請求會與該提供者分享一般瀏覽器／網路資訊以及所檢視的圖塊區域。Hiraku 不會要求您提供精確位置，也不會傳送住家地址。 ",
    "The map and list will update together.": "地圖和清單將同時更新。",
