    "You reported dependent-care costs and no older/disabled/blind member, so we used the 200% income guideline. The care costs themselves are not subtracted by this prescreen.": "您回報了受撫養者照護費用，且沒有年長、身心障礙或失明的成員，因此我們使用了 200% 的收入標準。本預先篩檢並未扣除照護費用本身。",
    "You reported income from work and a zero monthly total. Review these answers or ask HRA how to count your income.": "您回報了工作收入且每月總額為零。請檢視這些答案或向 HRA 詢問如何計算您的收入。",
    "You reported income from work, no older/disabled/blind member, no dependent-care costs, and that not everyone receives SSI or Cash Assistance, so we used the 150% income guideline.": "您回報了工作收入、沒有年長/身心障礙/失明成員、沒有受撫養者照護費用，且並非所有人都領取 SSI 或現金補助，因此我們使用了 150% 的收入標準。",
    "You reported no income from work, no older/disabled/blind member, no dependent-care costs, and that not everyone receives SSI or Cash Assistance, so we used the 130% income guideline.": "您回報沒有工作收入、沒有年長/身心障礙/失明成員、沒有受撫養者照護費用，且並非所有人都領取 SSI 或現金補助，因此我們使用了 130% 的收入標準。",
    "You reported paying child support but entered $0 paid this month. Review the answers or ask HRA which payments to count.": "您回報有支付贍養費，但本月填寫的金額為 $0。請檢視答案或向 HRA 詢問應計算哪些付款。",
    "You reported that everyone in your household receives SSI or Cash Assistance. The published prescreen supports potential eligibility through this assistance-based path.": "您回報您戶內的所有人都領取 SSI 或現金補助。已公布的預先篩檢支援透過此補助途徑獲得潛在資格。",
