    "Could SNAP help your household?": "Èske SNAP ta ka ede w nan kay ou?",
    "Count each person who receives either Supplemental Security Income (SSI) or a Cash Assistance grant. SSI is different from Social Security retirement benefits. If only some people receive these benefits, choose No.": "Konte chak moun ki resevwa Sipleman Revni Sekirite (Supplemental Security Income - SSI) oswa yon sibvansyon Asistans Lajan Kach (Cash Assistance). SSI diferan de benefis retrèt Sekirite Sosyal. Si se kèk moun sèlman ki resevwa benefis sa yo, chwazi Non.",
    "Count out-of-pocket care costs, such as paying a child-care provider or paying for care for an adult who needs help. This can change which income guideline applies.": "Konte depans swen ou peye nan pòch ou, tankou peye yon moun k ap gade timoun oswa peye pou swen yon granmoun ki bezwen èd. Sa ka chanje direktiv revni ki aplikab la.",
    "Discovery view": "Anviwonman dekouvèt",
    "Distances are calculated from an approximate ZIP/ZCTA internal point, not your address or a travel route. ": "Yo kalkile distans yo apati yon pwen entèn apwoksimatif kòd postal (ZIP/ZCTA), pa adrès ou oswa yon wout vwayaj. ",
    "Do not share names, addresses, Social Security numbers, case numbers, documents, or private case details. We cannot guarantee automatic redaction. Use fictional, general questions for this local demo.": "Pa pataje non, adrès, nimewo Sekirite Sosyal, nimewo dosye, dokiman, oswa detay prive sou dosye. Nou pa ka garanti eliminasyon otomatik enfòmasyon sa yo. Sèvi ak kesyon fiktif, jeneral pou demonstrasyon lokal sa a.",
    "Does anyone in your household have income from work?": "Èske gen nenpòt moun nan kay ou ki gen revni nan travay?",
