    "Does your household pay for child care or dependent care?": "Èske kay ou a peye pou gardri timoun oswa swen pou moun ki depann de ou?",
    "End conversation": "Fini konvèsasyon an",
    "English · General NYC SNAP guidance · Up to 5 minutes": "Angle · Gid jeneral SNAP pou Nouyòk (NYC) · Jiska 5 minit",
    "Enter a 5-digit ZIP code.": "Antre yon kòd postal ki gen 5 chif.",
    "Enter a NYC ZIP code to explore nearby stores.": "Antre yon kòd postal Nouyòk pou eksplore magazen ki toupre yo.",
    "Enter a NYC ZIP code to get started.": "Antre yon kòd postal Nouyòk pou kòmanse.",
    "Enter a monthly dollar amount of 0 or more, with up to two decimal places. Leave out commas and dollar signs, or choose I don’t know.": "Antre yon kantite lajan an dola chak mwa ki egal a 0 oswa plis, avèk jiska de chif apre desimal la. Pa met virg ak siy dola, oubyen chwazi M pa konnen.",
    "Enter a straight-line radius greater than 0 and up to 25 miles, or leave it blank.": "Antre yon reyon liy dwat ki pi gran pase 0 epi ki rive jiska 25 mil, oswa kite l vid.",
    "Enter a whole number of people, starting at 1, or choose I don’t know.": "Antre yon nonb antye moun, kòmanse ak 1, oswa chwazi Mwen pa konnen.",
    "Enter the total actually paid for children outside your SNAP household each month, including support withheld from pay. Include those withheld amounts in your gross income too, so we subtract them only once. Don’t enter support you receive or money owed but not paid. If you’re unsure which payments count, choose I don’t know.": "Antre total ou reyèlman peye chak mwa pou timoun ki pa nan kay SNAP ou a, ki gen ladan lajan yo kenbe sou salè w pou sipò. Mete montan yo kenbe yo nan revni brit ou tou, pou nou ka soustraje yo yon sèl fwa. Pa antre lajan sipò ou resevwa oswa lajan yo dwe ou men ki pa ko peye. Si ou pa sèten ki peman ki konte, chwazi Mwen pa konnen.",
