    "Follow the recertification instructions and deadline on your notice. Recertification is a different process from reapplying.": "Swiv enstriksyon ak dat limit pou rekonfimasyon an (recertification) ki sou avi ou a. Rekonfimasyon se yon pwosesis ki diferan de fè yon nouvo demann.",
    "For example, wages from a job, self-employment income, or income from a boarder. Money such as unemployment or Social Security alone is not income from work.": "Pa egzanp, salè nan yon travay, revni nan travay endependan, oswa revni nan men yon moun k ap lwe yon chanm. Lajan tankou chomaj oswa Sekirite Sosyal pou kont yo pa konsidere kòm revni travay.",
